\p{Experiment with moving my repos and site hosting onto tangled: mirror the main repos there and serve the sites from utensil.tngl.sh, then make the builds work under tangled's Spindle CI with a Nix flake for the TeX toolchain and a patched dvisvgm, while pushing heavy builds into a shared R2 depot that the other CI can pull from instead of rebuilding.}

